 your name, look at yourself in a mirror, and look at what is new on our black board! Now that is all for now but we will add much more in future updates!", "short_description": "Exotic Howlers is a game where you are a Black Howler is a big great world!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1M37mR9dBMIEI_qE9vdh_Vu71S1d51y92n-SuezpZcvc/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Qwertyquy", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sole-games.webador.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "800207691664872"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "6166808680094347", "version": "1.2.0"}, "id": "1261890014699192", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6066210656820817", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "6166808680094347"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LI